      "worked_solution": "From the given graph, we see that as $x$ approaches $2,$ the values of $f(x)$ increase, approaching $\\infty.$ \n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14227291/assets/4585f983dac68f3ac655fbaaed6481cd1479c4cffae2c10d9f08d991c6533f51.png)\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I only\".",
